["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nvidia After Jensen Huang, What Huang Meant to the AI Ecosystem, Washington Gets Its Revenge Neoclouds Mellanox / MVLink N-2 rule MSS honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-sharptech-黄仁勋下台不是桃色事件-是华盛顿对英伟达积怨已久的总清算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋下台不是桃色事件，是华盛顿对英伟达积怨已久的总清算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达对华出口政策上屡次顶撞国安系统，才是黄仁勋被赶下台背后真正的导火索，绯闻只是压垮他的最后一根稻草。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片禁令</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"187: 对话LiberAI刘松铭：Astra来袭，00后物理AI创始人看到的胜率 VLA WAM System 0/1/2 Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-latetalk-物理ai创始人提前押注硬件-基模一来-模型就会变薄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90e5508108d67243-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:09:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>物理AI创始人提前押注硬件：基模一来，模型就会变薄</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘松铭创业时就判断GPT-6 Astra这类基模会吃掉具身智能的「System 2」部分，于是从第一天就把硬件和产品做成护城河，而不是先做一家纯模型公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI红娘，3小时融资1500万｜王钦文对话曾歆勋 EV1匹配 T度\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-wangqinwen-良配巴不得用户尽快离开-这恰恰是它的赚钱逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">王</div><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>良配巴不得用户尽快离开，这恰恰是它的赚钱逻辑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">良配卖的是不可续费会员，用户配对成功就该走人——用户走得越快，平台要烧的token越少，这跟靠留存赚钱的多数AI产品正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">婚恋社交</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"156. 《侠》｜对影之刃零制作人梁其伟6小时访谈\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-zhangxiaojun-踩中风口在成功里只占1-99-是你是不是那块料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66aff61ecaa4b4d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">6:27:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>踩中风口在成功里只占1%，99%是你是不是那块料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梁其伟用自己多年做游戏的教训说：风口和资本叙事能撑起短期流水，但真正决定命运的，从来是创作者的心性而非外部环境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">武侠文化</span><span class=\"tag\">游戏行业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang Is Out at Nvidia Megaspeed entity list GTC TerraFab circular funding deals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-hardfork-黄仁勋因间谍绯闻辞任英伟达ceo-公司内部找不到能接替他的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋因间谍绯闻辞任英伟达CEO,公司内部找不到能接替他的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">继任的CFO只能是过渡CEO,因为英伟达的掌舵人必须同时是顶尖计算机科学家、能对台湾供应商发飙的强人，这种人目前只有黄仁勋一个。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Indonesia’s Mega Rice Failure peatland Mega Rice Project Dayak\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-asianometry-苏哈托为挽救政治声誉-把婆罗洲泥炭地烧成了灾难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c10c2e5a1a2f5743-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>苏哈托为挽救政治声誉，把婆罗洲泥炭地烧成了灾难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏哈托为延续「发展之父」声誉强推百万公顷稻田计划，却因泥炭地不适农耕、规划缺失，最终酿成东南亚史上最大碳排放火灾事件之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">环境政策</span><span class=\"tag\">农业史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why an early Alzheimer’s theory is making a comeback, the U.S.’s electricity crisis, and improving precision medicine cholinergic hypothesis nucleus basalis of Meynert HVDC / VSC All of Us pharmacogenomics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-sciencepod-阿尔茨海默病老牌假说被雪藏四十年-影像证据证明它可能是对的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b4ddc3718996fb27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>阿尔茨海默病老牌假说被雪藏四十年，影像证据证明它可能是对的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位年轻学者用影像数据证明，脑深部胆碱能神经元的退化先于、而非跟随皮层淀粉样蛋白沉积，让被淀粉样蛋白假说挤下舞台的老理论重新被认真对待。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿尔茨海默病</span><span class=\"tag\">淀粉样蛋白假说</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Anthropic on the cusp of RSI? Inside the redacted METR report | Luisa Rodriguez recursive self-improvement AI 2027\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-eightythousand-metr-发现-anthropic-用-ai-造-ai-速度已翻倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a5c1f36515a82c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">15:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>METR 发现 Anthropic 用 AI 造 AI，速度已翻倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">METR 调查认为，Anthropic 当前研发提速约八成来自用自家 AI 做研究，这正是外界警告多年的递归自我改进的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is the ‘War on Science’ Over? MAHA (Make America Healthy Again) filibuster\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-sciencevs-数据中心成了美国中期选举最大输家之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>数据中心成了美国中期选举最大输家之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">国会审批权没变但执行层已被政治筛查渗透；民主党拿下参众两院也撼动不了特朗普对科学的实际控制权，真正让选民投票的是AI数据中心的电费和噪音。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科研资助</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Next Era of Games: Mods, Agents, and Infinite Worlds modding decompilation 3.js\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-a16z-ai-让做游戏从十年压到两年-烂genre要迎来文艺复兴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让做游戏从十年压到两年，烂genre要迎来文艺复兴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GTA6 开发花了十二年，a16z 两位合伙人认为 AI 工具已经能把游戏原型周期压缩到数周，这会让工作室敢在冷门类型和新 IP 上下注，而不是只敢做续作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">游戏开发</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Powering AI-Driven Drug Discovery with President of Isomorphic Labs Max Jaderberg AlphaFold organoids / organs on a chip CRO (contract research organization)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-nopriors-药物研发卡住的根源不是审批太严-而是临床前看不见毒性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/75fbbd0fbc432e9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>药物研发卡住的根源不是审批太严，而是临床前看不见毒性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Isomorphic Labs 的判断是：药物成本飙升主要来自临床阶段的失败，而失败根源在于临床前根本看不到毒性——大鼠毒性测试对人类的预测力只有约三成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI制药</span><span class=\"tag\">药物研发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Network Science Transform Health and Nutrition? preferential attachment scale-free network disease module foodome dark matter of nutrition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-thejoyofwhy-食物里还藏着13-5万种-暗物质-分子-科学还不知道它们在做什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1991479e40b3c047-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Joy of Why</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>食物里还藏着13.5万种「暗物质」分子，科学还不知道它们在做什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">网络科学家发现，食物中除了约150种已知营养成分外，还有13.5万种从未被归类的分子——它们不提供能量，却像成千上万种药物一样在细胞里做微调控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络科学</span><span class=\"tag\">无标度网络</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Winners and Losers of Index Investing (Martin Schmalz) | #435 common ownership horizon-dependent risk aversion tragedy of the commons volatility laundering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-rationalreminder-指数基金对每个人都理性-模型里却可能让所有人集体变穷/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>指数基金对每个人都理性，模型里却可能让所有人集体变穷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当分散投资变得够便宜，资金从个股和债券涌入股市，推高股价、压低预期回报——每个人都做了对自己最优的选择，结果却可能是所有人一起变差，这是一场公地悲剧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数投资</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Origins of the Affordable Care Act Medicare for all single-payer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-throughline-肯尼迪晚年最大遗憾-1974年差点和尼克松谈成全民医保/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">28:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>肯尼迪晚年最大遗憾：1974年差点和尼克松谈成全民医保</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">尼克松在水门事件最绝望时提出的医改方案，比后来的奥巴马医保更激进，肯尼迪却因盟友压力放弃谈判，事后称这是他政治生涯最大的遗憾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗保险</span><span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robots on Fire: The Army’s $500 Million Factory Fiasco undefinitized contracting action flow forming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-papertrail-5亿美元炮弹新厂两年颗粒无收-军方却从不索回一分钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42070ee0db99b191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">34:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>5亿美元炮弹新厂两年颗粒无收，军方却从不索回一分钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">General Dynamics 从土耳其引进的新设备两年没造出一发合格炮弹，军队停了两条产线后仍照常支付进度款，既不索赔也不终止合同，反而继续给这家公司新合同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防采购</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Liquidating a whale by hand, 22 times margin call DeFi lending protocol wrapped token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-complexsys-手动清算一个巨鲸的仓位22次-杠杆率只是四年级除法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/869854f30ccd1804-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">22:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>手动清算一个巨鲸的仓位22次：杠杆率只是四年级除法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FTX崩盘期间，Solend上一个巨鲸账户资不抵债，程序没能自动清算，作者靠手动点按钮22次完成了清算机器人该做的事，顺带赚了约50%收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆</span><span class=\"tag\">DeFi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Nvidia&#x27;s Megaspeed Scandal Is Really All About NVIDIA Cloud Partner (NCP) AI diffusion rule remote access zero-day inferencing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-oddlots-nvidia对华芯片管控的最大漏洞-不卖芯片-租给你用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>NVIDIA对华芯片管控的最大漏洞：不卖芯片，租给你用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Megaspeed用46亿美元买进NVIDIA芯片转租阿里巴巴，远程访问不违法；NVIDIA核查后仍有5万块芯片下落不明，部分是最先进的Blackwell。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV Special: Measles Mini Symposium EMT (epithelial-mesenchymal transition) cGAS live cell extrusion air-liquid interface culture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-twiv-麻疹病毒三十年不变异-多突变同时发生在数学上不可能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>麻疹病毒三十年不变异：多突变同时发生在数学上不可能</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">麻疹是RNA病毒却几乎不变异，因为逃逸疫苗需要F蛋白和H蛋白同时发生多个突变，这在概率上几乎不可能实现，这也是同一支疫苗能用几十年的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗接种率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Plain of Jars: An Ancient Asian Mystery secondary burial MNI (minimum number of individuals) tooth ablation Secret War\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-ancients-老挝石缸之谜-石器摆在那-人骨却是公元1000年的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccb88a1d887baf32-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>老挝石缸之谜：石器摆在那，人骨却是公元1000年的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">石缸本身无法直接测年，但缸内外反复出现的人骨、牙齿拔除和1000年前后的年代，说明这套石缸丧葬传统可能一直延续到铁器时代之后很久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东南亚考古</span><span class=\"tag\">丧葬习俗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Rasputin Destroyed the Romanovs with Anthony Beevor Stavka\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-historyhit-拉斯普京唯一正确的建议-沙皇偏偏没听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc43533ed0928f37-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>拉斯普京唯一正确的建议，沙皇偏偏没听</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拉斯普京劝沙皇不要参战，这是他少数正确的建议，但沙皇恰恰在军事问题上从不听他的，却在人事任命上对他和皇后言听计从，最终拖垮整个帝国的行政体系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国革命</span><span class=\"tag\">罗曼诺夫王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"412. Lawrence of Arabia: Guerrilla Warfare In The Arab Revolt (Part 2) Sykes-Picot Treaty Balfour Declaration Hejaz Railway Arab Bureau Seven Pillars of Wisdom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-empirehist-劳伦斯真正背叛的不是阿拉伯人-而是自己效忠的大英帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">43:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯真正背叛的不是阿拉伯人，而是自己效忠的大英帝国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国情报官劳伦斯提前获悉英法瓜分阿拉伯世界的密约后，没有效忠大英帝国，而是告诉费萨尔「不要相信我政府的承诺」，自己先选了边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿拉伯起义</span><span class=\"tag\">劳伦斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"722. The Charge of the Light Brigade: The Tsar’s Terrible Siege (Part 2) Minié rifle sawback reconnaissance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-12-restishistory-俄军已主动撤围-英法却现编了一个入侵克里米亚的理由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d69379084116b18-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>俄军已主动撤围，英法却现编了一个入侵克里米亚的理由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">围攻西利斯特里亚解除后，英法在巴尔干的战争目标其实已经达成，入侵克里米亚、围攻塞瓦斯托波尔只是为了给已经出征的舰队和不满的舆论一个交代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">英国军事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is it intent or impact that matters in our relationships? (with Shwani Turner) locus of control light gassing PDA (pathological demand avoidance) declarative language decoupling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-clearerthink-责任不在意图也不在影响-而在于伤害是否可预见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>责任不在意图也不在影响，而在于伤害是否可预见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冲人大吼侮辱该自己负责；一句无害的称赞让对方崩溃，那更多是听者自己过去的经历在起作用，不该全算说话人的账。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人际关系</span><span class=\"tag\">自我责任</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"$20M Run Rate, Zero Co-Founders | Ben Cera, Polsia true solo free solo juiced solo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-11-solofounders-零联合创始人-一人公司把年化收入做到2000万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/347f00c2fdab662f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>零联合创始人，一人公司把年化收入做到2000万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">靠的不是秘密武器，而是他直接跳过了「找联合创始人」这一步——他认为多数联合创始人只是创始人图安心找的保险，真到决策时反而互相拖后腿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent创业</span>\n</div></div></a>"]